/target
# The excluded bindings build into their own target directories.
target/
corpus/data/
# Plan 14: corpora are fetched, pinned and never committed. `corpus-fetch`
# caches the verified archives in the first and extracts them into the second;
# `corpus/corpora.lock` is what reproduces both, and is the only part of this
# that belongs in git.
corpus/cache/
corpus/files/

# `corpus-run --report` writes a per-file record of one run: ~1 MB of JSON
# describing whichever corpora were on this machine at the time. It is a run
# artefact, not a baseline -- `corpus/ratchet.json` is the committed bar, and
# it is three orders of magnitude smaller.
corpus/report.json
testdata/golden/actual/
bindings/dotnet/bin/
bindings/dotnet/obj/
bindings/dotnet/runtimes/
bindings/*/Cargo.lock

# wasm-pack's output. Everything in it is generated from `Cargo.toml` and
# `src/` -- including `package.json`, which is why the npm package's version
# cannot drift from the workspace and `cargo xtask versions` has one manifest
# fewer to police.
bindings/js/pkg/
# `maturin build --out` and `dotnet pack -o` land here.
target/wheels/
target/nuget/

# The wasm determinism job tees its run here so the step can assert that
# tests actually executed. Transient, and equally so if you run that step
# by hand.
/determinism.log

# A crash artifact is transient: it gets minimised, and the minimised
# input lands as a test in the crate that owns the parser plus a seed in
# fuzz/corpus. Nothing in here is worth keeping.
fuzz/artifacts/

# `cargo fuzz coverage` merges a profile here, which is a build product of
# whichever binary and corpus it was pointed at.
fuzz/coverage/

# The .NET smoke project restores the packed TinkerPdf into its own folder so
# the restore cannot silently succeed against a global cache entry from an
# earlier run.
bindings/dotnet/tests/Smoke/packages/
bindings/dotnet/tests/Smoke/bin/
bindings/dotnet/tests/Smoke/obj/

# The browser demo's headless driver. Playwright is build tooling (rule 1's
# documented exception), installed on demand and never shipped.
bindings/js/demo/node_modules/
bindings/js/demo/package-lock.json
# Playwright MCP scratch, and the screenshots a manual demo run leaves behind.
.playwright-mcp/
